      "title": "actions-4: Add tooltip field to ActionDescriptor (separate from config name)",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "Add an explicit tooltip property to `ActionDescriptor`, distinct from `name` (config key), `label` (display), and `description` (long-form). Independent of the rename tasks.\n\nUpdate:\n- `heca/src/actions.rs`: `pub tooltip: Option<&'static str>` on `ActionDescriptor` (:65-82); populate in `ALL` where meaningful (e.g. delete-pane `tooltip: Some(\"Close the active pane\")`).\n- `heca/src/chrome/mod.rs`: `action_tooltip()` reads from the `ActionCatalog` tooltip when `Some`, falls back to `label` + shortcut when `None`.\n- `ActionCatalog` type + tests: carry the tooltip; add a test that `tooltip: Some(...)` surfaces via `action_tooltip`.\n- `AGENTS.md` (\"Chrome buttons → action, tooltip, KeyHint\" section): tooltip is now an `ActionDescriptor` property, not name-derived.\n\nGate: test suite + `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features` clean.",
