    {
      "id": "4f505d9d-b873-4107-8b2a-39ae76cc29b2",
      "phaseId": "8f760a9b-3ce8-4932-8286-67d742397f2e",
      "number": 271,
      "shortId": "NUNLY",
      "priority": 6,
      "shortName": "unified-open-registry",
      "title": "context-menu-6: ContextMenuRegistry + open_context_menu_for (unified open) + mouse refactor",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "DONE 2026-07-09. Built the unified context-menu open path + ContextMenuRegistry with 4 built-in providers + overlay_origin_mode (mode-restore field/hook). Behavior-preserving: mouse right-click + keyboard pane path route through the unified path with parity.\n\nImplemented:\n- `heca/src/chrome/context_menu.rs` (NEW): `ContextPath` (dotted string, consts PANE/SIDEBAR_PANE/SIDEBAR_COLUMN/SIDEBAR_WORKSPACE), `ContextTarget` enum (Pane{pane_id,hyperlink} / SidebarPane / SidebarColumn / SidebarWorkspace), `ContextMenuProvider` {weight: Vec<i64>, build: fn}, `ContextMenuRegistry::with_builtins()` (4 providers) + `register` + `items_for` + `ordered_providers`, `open_context_menu_for(state, path, target, anchor, source, origin)` (registry lookup → merge by weight → open_dropdown; centered derived from source=Keyboard; captures overlay_origin_mode when None), `restorable_mode` (SidebarNav whitelist). 5 unit tests.\n- `heca/src/chrome/mod.rs`: `mod context_menu;` + pub(crate) exports (open_context_menu_for, ContextMenuProvider, ContextMenuRegistry, ContextPath, ContextTarget).\n- `heca/src/app_state.rs`: fields `overlay_origin_mode: Option<InputMode>` (:664) + `context_menu_registry: ContextMenuRegistry` (:709).\n- `heca/src/app/startup.rs`: init both fields (:368/:378, registry via with_builtins()).\n- `heca/src/chrome/overlay.rs`: `resolve()` (:362) restores input_mode when the last overlay closes and overlay_origin_mode is Some — BEFORE running the completion (so a follow-up confirm opens with origin already restored; origin consumed before completion may push a new overlay). No-op when origin None (Normal).\n- `heca/src/mouse.rs`: `open_context_menu` (mouse pane) → open_context_menu_for(PANE, PaneTarget{pane_id,hyperlink resolved from click}, MouseContent, None); `open_focused_context_menu` (keyboard pane) → open_context_menu_for(PANE, PaneTarget{focused, None}, window_center, Keyboard, None); `open_sidebar_context_menu` → maps ChromeDragItem→(path,target) → open_context_menu_for(...,MouseLeftSidebar,None). `pane_action_items` moved into context_menu.rs (pane provider).\n\nVerify: cargo check clean (no project warnings); cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features clean; cargo test -p heca context_menu 5/5 pass; full heca suite green. heca-core flaky terminal test fails only under full-workspace concurrent load (preexisting, not touched by this slice — passes in isolation 88/88).\n\nDependencies: none (foundation). context-menu-7 depends on this.",
