    {
      "id": "a721d49b-827e-4dce-bffb-2e4270c08c5d",
      "phaseId": "8f760a9b-3ce8-4932-8286-67d742397f2e",
      "number": 272,
      "shortId": "REFR5",
      "priority": 7,
      "shortName": "keyboard-context-aware",
      "title": "context-menu-7: resolve_active_context + prefix arm + pending_context + mode-restore (keyboard context-aware)",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "DONE 2026-07-09. Keyboard context-aware menus: prefix+> now works everywhere (pane in Normal, sidebar item in SidebarNav), with mode-restore so the user returns to SidebarNav after closing a menu opened from the sidebar.\n\nImplemented:\n- `resolve_active_context(state)` in context_menu.rs: reads InputMode + sidebar cursor (SidebarNav) or focused pane (Normal) → (ContextPath, ContextTarget). SidebarItem→(path,target) mapping: Pane→sidebar.pane, Column→sidebar.column, Workspace→sidebar.workspace, FloatingPane→pane.\n- `PendingContext` struct in context_menu.rs: carries (path, target, origin: Option<InputMode>) through the Prefix→Normal dispatch transition.\n- `pending_context: Option<PendingContext>` on AppState (app_state.rs:711), init None (startup.rs:379).\n- Prefix arm in handle_sidebar_nav_mode (input.rs:651-665): mirrors handle_selection_mode pattern — resolves active context BEFORE the Prefix transition, stashes in pending_context with origin=Some(SidebarNav), transitions to Prefix mode.\n- handle_open_context_menu (handlers.rs:188-207): consumes pending_context if present → open_context_menu_for with the stashed (path,target,origin); else falls back to open_focused_context_menu (Normal mode).\n- window_center_logical made pub(crate) (mouse.rs:89) for handlers.rs access.\n\nMode-restore (overlay_origin_mode) was already implemented in context-menu-6 — this task wires it: when origin=Some(SidebarNav) is passed, open_context_menu_for captures it, and overlay::resolve() restores SidebarNav when the last overlay closes.\n\nVerify: cargo check + clippy clean (zero warnings); cargo test --workspace green (heca-core flaky preexisting). Manual: prefix+e → sidebar nav, j/k select item, prefix+> → context menu centered for that item, Esc → back in SidebarNav (not Normal).",
