      "title": "button-shortcut-1: Button::shortcut(char) + accelerator dispatch",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "`Button::shortcut(char)` → composed `Icon(NerdFont ⌃) + Label(letter)` trailing slot rendered **inside** the button (via the content-slot refactor from `viewnode-task-2`). `Ctrl+<c>` self-submit + `FocusManager::deliver_accelerator`.\n\nBLOCKED on:\n- `viewnode-task-2` (Button content-slot refactor — must land first).\n- `gridui-03` `NfIcon` (NerdFont embedding — the accelerator icon uses NerdFont; Phosphor caret was judged ugly). `Glyph::CaretUp` (0xe13c) stays in the enum but the accelerator uses NerdFont.\n\nFiles: `heca-grid-ui/src/widgets/button.rs` (shortcut API + trailing slot), `heca-grid-ui/src/component.rs` / `FocusManager` (`deliver_accelerator`).\n\nBehaviors to preserve: existing Button variants/sizes/labels unchanged; theme-driven styling; the accelerator is an additive trailing slot (empty by default → no layout shift). Update `docs/widgets.md` + showcase.",
